@startuml gnss_diagnostic_seq_lpm
title 3. Low Power Mode entry / exit

actor "Power Mgmt" as PM
participant "power_mode_controller"   as PMC
participant "gnss_diagnostic_manager" as MGR
participant "i_dtc_monitor"           as MON
participant "recovery_manager"        as REC

== Entering LPM ==
PM  -> PMC : notify(low_power)
PMC -> MGR : pause()
MGR -> MON : pause()
note right of MON : freezes debounce timers,\nignores subsequent on_pvt/on_antenna
MGR -> REC : pause()
note right of REC : freezes escalation timers

== While in LPM ==
note over MGR
  on_tick() short-circuits.
  No DTCs are set or cleared while paused.
  Chip is OFF; no events arrive.
end note

== Exiting LPM ==
PM  -> PMC : notify(active)
PMC -> MGR : resume()
MGR -> MON : resume(now)
note right of MON : fail_run / ok_run cleared\nso debounce restarts cleanly
MGR -> REC : resume(now)
note right of REC : armed_at / level1_at = now\n(LPM time does not count)

@enduml
